        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Giing'eeta sinita gheeda sibata ASEETA",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 2:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata gagasa Sulemani ghwadeas gheeda aba gheawunga NG'UTAMIIDA, ea gheeda sugoocheanduumeeda was daanyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.2.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.2.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 2:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gageanu Sulemani fih sagalamnyooji laadam ea damanamughuush jea gwasareeni haleanjeeda, ea fih sagalamnyooji seedam jea gwanyarjeawi lagheanga aba giijeega, ea fih sagalamnyooji samwagu ea bughalaji lah jea gamineadaysa saawa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.2.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.2.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 2:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Goojeakta Sulemani buuneeda heeda Huramu, was sugoocheanda Diro, ak gwayeesha, “Gawuurji gidisimi ghweandeanyu was Dawdi, aba giidawda gubooyeeka, gwadeeksheesa geaw gheeda jea goobiida jeeda, eara aniini hinduneani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.2.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.2.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 2:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ula ghaadeaschi gheeda aba gheawunga NG'UTAMIIDA, was ASEETEANYU, ak ghaaghaydiichi ghoah heeda wagiida, aba lukghumajeega sigwariida ng'andidi, ea mukaateeyda giihiimnooda bea galeagasean, ea haleanjeeda wagiida sigwariida bea sakteayda ea shing'ada, ea gea eawoojiga sabaato, ea gea sheeda eesh, ea gea ghweelmeeda ghayi rugu NG'UTAMIIDA, was ASEETEANYA. Nih diigheanda manda muudeanooda gil aba heeda fuga Israeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.2.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.2.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 2:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea gheeda jea dadeas gajea haw, aba gideaba ASEETEANYU eahaweewa aseecheeka suuk. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.2.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.2.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 2:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gajea ng'eaha siichea ghoamu gwadeeksa gheeda aba gideaba humng'eeda moamu ghoahiit niny, ghana humng'eeda sheagi? Ak aniini ghaawaschi ng'eaha ea daamu dadeeksa niny gheeda, jea dagwardeaysa niny hideeda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.2.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.2.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 2:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asi ajeakneani siida was gearnoocheanda aba gadiyeeda dahaabu, ea lapiya, ea shiliingajeega, ea gharinga, ea gea oomng'i, ea gea areeri, ea gea nyawiiri, siida ammu ghang'oar ng'ooruutka sea fuga was gearnoodiga mida Yuda ea Yerusalemu sea aniini, ghayi iini hoowa ghweandeanyu was Dawdi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.2.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.2.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 2:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak giyeanean gicha eara gubooyeeka, ea hoonyaweanda, ea beehajeega mareambiida aba Lebanoni, aba gideaba ghaanali gideaba fugaagu bea gadiyeeda ghoamu lajita geediga aba Lebanoni. Ak nea fugeasu bea gadiyeeda gaygwandeayi sea fugaagu bea gadiyeeda, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.2.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.2.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 2:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ak abeeda gwalagu geediga saang'a jea gwadeayi aba gideaba gheeda jea dadeas gajea haw nea daamdaamwaat. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.2.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.2.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 2:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak ging'ulayi gaydaadaw fugaagu bea gadiyeeda, fuga beara geediga, mushoodaw sagalamnyooji diktam bea ngaano gea goola ealas, ea mushoodaw sagalamnyooji diktam bea nganooyda siguura shayiiri, ea liitaji sagalamnyooji diktam bea difaayi, ea liitaji sagalamnyooji diktam bea nagheeda.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.2.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.2.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 2:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea Hirameeda was sugoocheanda Diro ghwasha aba barawajeanda ajeaksa heeda Sulemani, “Aba gideaba NG'UTAMIIDA ghabwariiy fugaaschi, ninung' was sugoocheanda jea ghoahaaghwa saawa.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.2.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.2.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 2:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gabiikta gwayi Hiramu, “Gagasa eekghaambiit NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEETA fuga Israeli, ghayi sin humng'eeda ea ng'eanyiida, ghayi adawa sugoocheanda was Dawdi orjeeda haw fughara, mideawa weaghuumeeda ea nalita ng'asheega, was siichea ghwadeas gheeda sibatiisa ASEETA bea NG'UTAMIIDA, ea gheanyi bea sugoocheanduumeeda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.2.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.2.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 2:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Asi ghamneawa neajeakneey siida was gearnoocheanda, haw fughara, siguura Huramabi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.2.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.2.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 2:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "was orjeeda jih gatmooda eemeeda Dani, nea ghwaan ea siida ng'eanyiida Diro gil. Niny ea geariir aba gadiyeeda dahaabu, ea lapiya, ea lagheanga oomng'i, gharinga, ea lagheanga, ea geediga, ea oormajeega oomng'i, ea gea nyawiiri, ea gea areeri, ea hang'weaka bumbuni, nea ghoamu gwasin ng'ooruutka sean, nea ghoamu ghoang'waayi ak gwasin gichea eataw gwasin, sea gearnoodigaagu sean gearnoodiga siideanyu haw, Dawdeeda was ghweandaang'u. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.2.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.2.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 2:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak ghamneawa ngaano ea nganooyda siguura shayiiri, ea nagheeda ea difaayeeda nibaloola siideanyu haw, danung' gweasa fugaaschi bea gadiyeeda; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.2.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.2.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 2:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ak gajeelagu geediga nyooh gasa aba Lebanoni, ak gajeerata ak geanung' ghapka headaang'u nea gapkeana badayda beega basooda Yafa, ak abeeda ghwaat ea ghwahita Yerusalemu.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.2.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.2.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ghang'eat deekshooda gheeda sibatiisa ASEETA",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 2:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.2.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.2.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 2:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata gwayiida Sulemani fuga sean was rabasta mida jeeda ng'eanyiida Israeli, iing'ata iitooda nyaawa ghayi sin Dawdeeda was ghwaan; ak mooneeda nyagaan gaba fih sagalamnyooji bughala ea haradam ea damasamwagu ea bughalaji lah. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.2.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.2.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 2:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak aba jeeda nyaawa fih sagalamnyooji laadam ea damanamughuush gealoat ghoah fuga jea gwasareeni sareenda, nea fih sagalamnyooji seedam geanung' ghoah fuga jea gwanyarjeawi lagheanga aba heayeeniga, ak fih sagalamnyooji samwagu ea bughalaji lah, geanung' ghoah gea jea gamineadaysa suurja ghwanung' gagadiiy.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.2.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.2.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
